---
const checks = [
  'Diagnóstico electrónico gratuito en la primera visita',
  'Presupuesto aprobado por el cliente antes de iniciar',
  'Garantía escrita: 3 meses o 3.000 km en mano de obra',
  'Repuestos con certificado de origen — sin piezas falsas',
  'Mecánicos certificados por los fabricantes',
];
---

<section id="garantia" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#100D08] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Left -->
      <div class="reveal-left">
        <span class="tag-label mb-6 inline-flex">La diferencia</span>
        <h2 class="font-display leading-[0.9] mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);">
          <span class="text-[#EDE5D8]">MECÁNICA</span><br>
          <span style="color:#E8520A;">CON GARANTÍA</span><br>
          <span class="text-[#EDE5D8]">REAL.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.8] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.5)] mb-10 max-w-[460px]">
          No solo reparamos motos — construimos confianza. Cada trabajo sale documentado, cada precio se acuerda antes y cada pieza tiene origen verificado.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-10">
          {checks.map((c, i) => (
            <li class={`flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.875rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.65)] reveal d${i+1}`}>
              <span class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 border border-[rgba(232,82,10,0.4)] bg-[rgba(232,82,10,0.08)] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E8520A" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              {c}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary">Agendar servicio →</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: two stacked cards -->
      <div class="reveal-right space-y-4">

        <!-- "Sin nosotros" card -->
        <div class="border border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.06)] bg-[#181208] p-7">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
            <span class="text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.25)] border border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.1)] px-3 py-1">Sin Motor Store</span>
          </div>
          {['Diagnóstico incierto o de pago','Precios variables sin explicación','Sin garantía por escrito','Esperas largas e indefinidas'].map(t => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 border-b border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.04)] last:border-0">
              <span class="text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.2)] font-bold">×</span>
              <span class="text-[0.85rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.3)]">{t}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- "Con nosotros" card — highlighted -->
        <div class="border border-[rgba(232,82,10,0.4)] bg-[#1C1308] p-7 relative"
             style="box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(232,82,10,0.08);">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-[#E8520A]"></div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
            <span class="text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[#E8520A] border border-[rgba(232,82,10,0.4)] px-3 py-1 bg-[rgba(232,82,10,0.08)]">Con Motor Store</span>
          </div>
          {['Diagnóstico electrónico gratuito','Cotización fija sin sorpresas','Garantía 3 meses / 3.000 km','Entrega en el tiempo prometido'].map(t => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 border-b border-[rgba(232,82,10,0.1)] last:border-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E8520A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[0.875rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.75)]">{t}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
